WEBVTT

00:00:00.611 --> 00:00:02.765
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Nadine, France</b>

00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:06.956
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> I have breakfast in a great café near my office.

00:00:07.613 --> 00:00:11.977
I have a croissant and coffee – an espresso with hot milk.

00:00:12.449 --> 00:00:14.340
Mmmm. I love breakfast!

00:00:14.649 --> 00:00:16.048
It’s my favourite meal.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.171
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Pablo, Argentina</b>

00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:25.334
<v><b>Pablo:</b></v> I have breakfast at home, but I don’t have a big breakfast.

00:00:26.313 --> 00:00:29.885
I have fruit and yogurt, and sometimes toast.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:31.953
It’s a healthy breakfast.

00:00:33.081 --> 00:00:35.464
That’s a good thing at the beginning of the day.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.595
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Rob, UK</b>

00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:43.786
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I don’t eat in the morning – I’m not hungry.

00:00:44.373 --> 00:00:46.251
I just have a coffee at work.

00:00:46.705 --> 00:00:50.718
But I have lunch early, at about 12.30.

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.085
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Sakura, Japan</b>

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.890
<v><b>Sakura:</b></v> I really like breakfast.

00:00:58.332 --> 00:01:01.103
It’s an important meal for Japanese people.

00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:04.557
I have breakfast at home with my family.

00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:07.066
We have a traditional breakfast.

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:10.443
It isn’t very different from lunch and dinner.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:15.873
We have rice, fish, and miso soup and we drink green tea.

00:01:16.512 --> 00:01:18.672
We don’t drink a lot of coffee in my family.